{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"9":"Zakat (Kitab Al-Zakat)"},"section_detail":{"9":{"hadithnumber_first":1556,"hadithnumber_last":1700,"arabicnumber_first":1556,"arabicnumber_last":1700,"name_native":"كتاب الزكاة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1557,"arabicnumber":1557,"text":"حدثنا ابن السرح، وسليمان بن داود، قالا اخبرنا ابن وهب، اخبرني يونس، عن الزهري، قال قال ابو بكر ان حقه اداء الزكاة وقال عقالا","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Shadh"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Shadh"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (7284، 7285) Sahih Muslim (20)"}],"reference":{"book":9,"hadith":2}}]}